  "slug": "karen-ebbs",
  "statement": "Abstract painting and colour are central to my practice and visual language.  I am curious about  perception, consciousness and the nature of reality, which I explore through thinking and making.  Working intuitively, I make large-scale artworks spanning sculpture and installation, bringing elements together to create immersive spaces.",
